  "pitchEmail": "Hi Seth,\n\nHere it is. Two versions attached — open them on your phone, that is where your customers will see it.\n\nThey are the same website. The only difference is the logo: one uses the logo you have, the other uses a version I redrew. Pick whichever you like. There is a third file that shows the two side by side and explains what I changed and why.\n\nThe part worth looking at is the services list. Tap a few — a weekly hot tub plan, a pool opening, whatever — and the bar at the bottom adds them up and lets someone text you the whole request in one go. That is the thing Vagaro and Booksy charge a monthly fee for. Yours is built in and costs nothing per month.\n\nThe rest of it:\n- Built for a phone first, tested down to a 320px screen\n- Loads instantly, no trackers, works even with a bad signal\n- Your number is tappable everywhere, with a call bar that follows people down the page\n- Google markup for your hours, service area and location, so you can show up in local search\n- Hot tub service priced monthly and year-round; pools seasonal, with the opening and closing visits priced separately\n\nNothing is live yet. This is just so you can see it.\n\n$750 to put it on your own domain, live in 5 business days. $60/month after that if you want me hosting it, keeping it backed up and making changes whenever you need them — cancel any time. The logo files are yours either way, no charge.\n\nIf you don't like it, you don't pay, and you keep the page regardless.\n\nFour things I need from you before it goes live:\n\n1. Your email address, so it goes on the site\n2. A look over the prices — I put in normal Omaha rates so the page worked, but they are mine, not yours. Every one needs your say-so.\n3. Three reviews from customers, with their names as they wrote them. I will not make any up, and right now that is the only real gap on the page.\n4. Your exact town, so the service area is right. I have Omaha and the metro on there.\n\nIf swinleyspaservices.com is free I would grab it now, before anything else.\n\nTyler McManus\nMcManus Web Co.\n302-649-6600\n",
